    "head_commit_message": "feat(tools): the digest writes a named outcome trace (spec 37 step 1)\n\nformation_digest.gd gains only=, trace=, from= and to=: one run's ticks in a window\nwritten as JSON lines, every squad and unit field by its name. The hashed state and\nits field names (SQUAD_FIELDS, UNIT_FIELDS) move to tools/digest_state.gd unchanged;\nthe writer is tools/digest_trace.gd. Floats are written as var_to_str's shortest\nexact text, since JSON.stringify's full precision rounds the 17th digit wrong.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EjD7H88Dqd82gjeBS3Xmyo",
